    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play as the Growmancer, a wizard traveling worlds with his canine companion to transform wastelands into fertile grounds and battle destructive wildfires. Upgrade both via a skill tree. Challenge yourself or just relax.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Growmancer, a mysterious sorcerer dedicated to greening barren worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/37a5f509fd7548c92aefc9d5fde5813e.poster.avif?t=1750683693\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/37a5f509fd7548c92aefc9d5fde5813e.webm?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/37a5f509fd7548c92aefc9d5fde5813e.mp4?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through an expansive skill tree to unlock potent abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/2931d8e8abd7145ec0c3c5733ff54b3e.poster.avif?t=1750683693\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/2931d8e8abd7145ec0c3c5733ff54b3e.webm?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/2931d8e8abd7145ec0c3c5733ff54b3e.mp4?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon steadfast allies to assist in nurturing these new worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/ef9404057d6779a6659afe34ce35a59e.poster.avif?t=1750683693\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/ef9404057d6779a6659afe34ce35a59e.webm?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/ef9404057d6779a6659afe34ce35a59e.mp4?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And defend vibrant ecosystems from destructive wildfires!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/176c0d0d558f9b5ea7ff98a2487fa594.poster.avif?t=1750683693\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/176c0d0d558f9b5ea7ff98a2487fa594.webm?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/176c0d0d558f9b5ea7ff98a2487fa594.mp4?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Growmancer:</strong> Embody a wizard journeying through devastated worlds, transforming them into blooming gardens and controlling destructive wildfires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loyal Canine Companion:</strong> Your faithful dog assistant on your travels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Upgrades:</strong> Collect flowers and invest them in a skill tree, unlocking improvements for both the Growmancer and your dog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong> Land transformation, fighting wildfires, resource gathering, and ability upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty:</strong> Choose between a relaxing experience or a challenge demanding intense focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elements of Random Generation:</strong> Ensuring variety across multiple playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> Approximately 2 hours for a single playthrough, but countless hours for those looking to replay, achieve 100% of achievements, or aim for higher scores.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Play as the Growmancer, a wizard traveling worlds with his canine companion to transform wastelands into fertile grounds and battle destructive wildfires. Upgrade both via a skill tree. Challenge yourself or just relax.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Growmancer, a mysterious sorcerer dedicated to greening barren worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/37a5f509fd7548c92aefc9d5fde5813e.poster.avif?t=1750683693\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/37a5f509fd7548c92aefc9d5fde5813e.webm?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/37a5f509fd7548c92aefc9d5fde5813e.mp4?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through an expansive skill tree to unlock potent abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/2931d8e8abd7145ec0c3c5733ff54b3e.poster.avif?t=1750683693\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/2931d8e8abd7145ec0c3c5733ff54b3e.webm?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/2931d8e8abd7145ec0c3c5733ff54b3e.mp4?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon steadfast allies to assist in nurturing these new worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/ef9404057d6779a6659afe34ce35a59e.poster.avif?t=1750683693\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/ef9404057d6779a6659afe34ce35a59e.webm?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/ef9404057d6779a6659afe34ce35a59e.mp4?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And defend vibrant ecosystems from destructive wildfires!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/176c0d0d558f9b5ea7ff98a2487fa594.poster.avif?t=1750683693\" width=800 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/176c0d0d558f9b5ea7ff98a2487fa594.webm?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690720/extras/176c0d0d558f9b5ea7ff98a2487fa594.mp4?t=1750683693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Awaits You:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Growmancer:</strong> Embody a wizard journeying through devastated worlds, transforming them into blooming gardens and controlling destructive wildfires.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loyal Canine Companion:</strong> Your faithful dog assistant on your travels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incremental Upgrades:</strong> Collect flowers and invest them in a skill tree, unlocking improvements for both the Growmancer and your dog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Mechanics:</strong> Land transformation, fighting wildfires, resource gathering, and ability upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Difficulty:</strong> Choose between a relaxing experience or a challenge demanding intense focus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elements of Random Generation:</strong> Ensuring variety across multiple playthroughs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> Approximately 2 hours for a single playthrough, but countless hours for those looking to replay, achieve 100% of achievements, or aim for higher scores.</p></li></ul>",
